{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626910/extras/6b762d94a9c70c3e624c2247a4fe2cb8.avif?t=1759309441\" width=800 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're trapped in an old Cold War submarine. Your only goal: survive. Complete urgent repairs, manage limited resources, and keep the systems running. You can\u2019t see each other. One misstep, one wrong call, and it\u2019s all over.\u2028</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use your voice. Trust your partner. And don't run out of time.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626910/extras/598489776f53dc9c1a348e8c1dd4b97f.avif?t=1759309441\" width=800 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll never make it alone. Communicate through a crackling walkie-talkie. One speaks, the other listens - no exceptions. Relay codes, fix malfunctions, and guide each other through a maze of rust, steam, and shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2028<strong>Forget clear sight. All you\u2019ve got is each other\u2019s voice. Keep it steady.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626910/extras/abd1fa616ce87141e7eaee39848e1b9e.avif?t=1759309441\" width=800 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time is not your friend. Each second wasted brings your doom closer - flooding compartments, failing engines, failing minds. Complete your tasks quickly. Stay calm under pressure. And if you mess up?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You\u2019ll hear it. Feel it. Maybe even see it... before the ocean swallows you whole.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3626910?t=1759309441","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626910/aad73c766ce75c33a72c8c0db0183336e937c976/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759309441","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626910/d4a6e1c04c8a06add94c04768d58785af57c0bd3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759309441","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626910/d4a6e1c04c8a06add94c04768d58785af57c0bd3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759309441","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626910/extras/6b762d94a9c70c3e624c2247a4fe2cb8.avif?t=1759309441\" width=800 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're trapped in an old Cold War submarine. Your only goal: survive. Complete urgent repairs, manage limited resources, and keep the systems running. You can\u2019t see each other. One misstep, one wrong call, and it\u2019s all over.\u2028</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use your voice. Trust your partner. And don't run out of time.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626910/extras/598489776f53dc9c1a348e8c1dd4b97f.avif?t=1759309441\" width=800 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll never make it alone. Communicate through a crackling walkie-talkie. One speaks, the other listens - no exceptions. Relay codes, fix malfunctions, and guide each other through a maze of rust, steam, and shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2028<strong>Forget clear sight. All you\u2019ve got is each other\u2019s voice. Keep it steady.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626910/extras/abd1fa616ce87141e7eaee39848e1b9e.avif?t=1759309441\" width=800 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time is not your friend. Each second wasted brings your doom closer - flooding compartments, failing engines, failing minds. Complete your tasks quickly. Stay calm under pressure. And if you mess up?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You\u2019ll hear it. Feel it. Maybe even see it... before the ocean swallows you whole.</strong></p>","developers":["Low Effort Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626910/f4e2617c2e45cd4bf47682bf8a32c8cab6600e70/header.jpg?t=1759309441","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3626910/1878252252/434f11907f4f4414c1c7cbe99b1db0df50e865c9/1750456734/dash_av1.mpd?t=1749472878","dash_h264"